ometres Sprint, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "350023"} "12.5 kilometres Pursuit, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "350024"} "15 kilometres Mass Start, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "350025"} "20 kilometres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "350026"} "4 × 7.5 kilometres Relay, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "350027"} "7.5 kilometres Sprint, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "350028"} "10 kilometres Pursuit, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "350029"} "12.5 kilometres Mass Start, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "350030"} "15 kilometres, Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "350031"} "4 × 6 kilometres Relay, Women"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "9000230"} "2018"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/1001"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "2 × 6 kilometres and 2 × 7.5 kilometres Relay, Mixed" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "19 February 2014 — 18:30"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/889"} "Kompleks Dlya Sorevnovaniy Po Lyzhnym Gonkam i Biatlonu Laura, Mountain Cluster, Krasnaya Polyana"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/350032"} "64 from 16 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "Eight shots for each group of five targets. Penalty loop (150 metres) skied for each missed target."]] [:tr {} [:th {:valign "top"} "Details"] [:td {} "Course Length: 5,995 m / 7,741 m" [:br {}] "Height Differential: 29 m / 31 m" [:br {}] "Maximum Climb: 28 m / 31 m" [:br {}] "Shooting 1: Prone at 1.992 km, 50 m range / Prone at 2.574 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Shooting 2: Standing at 3.943 km, 50 m range / Standing at 5.107 km, 50 m range" [:br {}] "Total Climbing: 354 m / 516 m"]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "This was the début of biathlon mixed relay at the Olympics and the favorites were the Norwegians, who did not disappoint as they won the gold medal. Norway had won the event at the past three World Championships, and their four team members, " [:a {:href "/athletes/84154"} "Ole Einar Bjørndalen"] ", " [:a {:href "/athletes/111029"} "Emil Hegle Svendsen"] ", " [:a {:href "/athletes/110008"} "Tora Berger"] ", and " [:a {:href "/athletes/128184"} "Tiril Eckhoff"] " had already won individual biathlon medals in Sochi. With the team’s victory, Bjørndalen collected his 13th Olympic medal, setting a new Winter Olympic record for the most medals ever won, surpassing his former teammate, cross-country skiier " [:a {:href "/athletes/85378"} "Bjørn Dæhlie"] ". Norway was almost perfect in its shooting, as only Berger, on the opening leg, missed any shots, and with her extra shots, she cleaned up those misses. Eckhoff dropped back to second on her leg, as the Czech Republic’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/118522"} "Gabriela Soukalová"] " put her team ahead, but Bjørndalen gave Norway a lead they never relinquished, as he handed Svendsen a 43.1 second margin for his anchor leg, which became an effective victory lap. The Czech Republic held on for second with Italy taking a surprising bronze medal."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Germany, who originally placed fourth, was disqualified after " [:a {:href "/athletes/100986"} "Evi Sachenbacher-Stehle"] " failed a drug test. On 1 December 2017 " [:a {:href "/athletes/101172"} "Olga Zaytseva"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/128304"} "Olga Vilukhina"] " were disqualified after findings of the Oswald Commission into Russian doping at Sochi 2014. Both appealed their disqualification. Zaytseva’s disqualification was upheld, while Vilukhina was reinstated. However, because of Zaytseva’s disqualification, the Russian team was disqualified. They had originally placed fifth before the disqualification of Germany, and had moved up to fourth, so no medals were affected by any of the drug rulings in this event."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {} "Misses"] [:th {} "Extra Shots"] [:th {} "Shooting 1 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 1 Extra Shots"] [:th {} "Shooting 1"] [:th {} "Shooting 2 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 2 Extra Shots"] [:th {} "Shooting 2"] [:th {} "Exchange"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Norway"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NOR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NOR.png"}] "NOR"]] [:td {} "1-09:17.0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "– (–)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "– (–)"] [:td {} "– (–)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "Lead-Off"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/110008"} "Tora Berger"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "15:55.6"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "5:59.8 (4)"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "11:54.4 (5)"] [:td {} "15:55.6 (1)"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2nd Leg"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/128184"} "Tiril Eckhoff"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "16:11.9"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "22:16.7 (1)"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "28:00.9 (1)"] [:td {} "32:07.5 (2)"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3rd Leg"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/84154"} "Ole Einar Bjørndalen"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "17:50.9"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "38:57.4 (1)"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "45:09.6 (1)"] [:td {} "49:58.4 (1)"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr